<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Examine</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>examine &lt;thing or person&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>examine chest
</pre>
<p>Looks closely at something or someone: it works like look at and look in 
together. You see the description, and:
</p>
<ul><li>for a container, what is inside it; for a bottle or other drink container, what is in it;</li>
<li>for a weapon, which fighting style it needs;</li>
<li>whether it gives off light or darkness, and any auras your detect spells let you see, such as good or evil, magic or poison;</li>
<li>for a person or a monster, what they wear and wield, whether there is a reward on their head, whether they are a protected citizen or an outlaw wanted by the law, and whether they carry the scar of the Book of Blood.</li></ul>
<p>You can examine things while sitting.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
